@@ -15,3 +15,20 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Agent tools
+
+In browsers that support [WebMCP](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/imperative-api),
+the hydrated sign-in page exposes `sign_in` and the sign-up page exposes `sign_up`.
+Both tools require `{ username: string, password: string }` and return
+`{ success: boolean, message: string }`. They submit to the existing account API,
+update the form's loading and status messages, and do not return passwords or tokens.
+Sign-up creates an account; sign-in retains the application's existing behavior
+of displaying the login result without storing a session token.
+
+Tools register through `document.modelContext` (with support for the earlier
+`navigator.modelContext` preview) and are removed when the form unmounts.
+Browsers without WebMCP continue to support ordinary form submissions.
+
+Run the non-browser tool checks with `node --test tests/*.test.ts` and build with
+`pnpm build`.
